    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels so heavy. like, even if i tried to change things, the system is too big. there's no way to actually win against it. i'm just waiting for the day i eventually burn out or get fired and then it's just over. it feels like the only thing i actually own is this feeling of being stuck.",
